      isoTitle: "O(1) Ephemeral Memory Isolation & Pixel Blocking: Why Temporary Email Beats Spam Filters",
      isoSubtitle: "How ephemeral containers sever cross-site correlation chains, block hidden surveillance pixels, and protect your digital identity from data broker dossiers.",
      isoHighlight1: "Deterministic O(1) container isolation protected by cryptographic session tokens.",
      isoHighlight2: "Strict default blocking of external tracking pixels and images to safeguard your real IP address.",
      isoHighlight3: "Absolute automated shredding of all emails and records after 20 minutes with zero persistence.",
      isoHighlight4: "Complete immunity to data broker profiling and aggressive retargeting campaigns.",
      isoSec1Title: "Why Standard Inboxes (Gmail / Outlook) Fail at Privacy",
      isoSec1P1: "When you sign up for web services with your primary personal email, marketing networks link that address to your device fingerprints, telephone numbers, and purchase histories. Deleting your account later does not erase your profile from commercial data broker databases.",
      isoSec1P2: "Furthermore, commercial emails frequently embed 1x1 invisible tracking pixels. Opening an email in standard webmail immediately exposes your real IP address, city, operating system, and open timestamps to third-party ad networks.",
      isoSec2Title: "Mathematical O(1) Isolation and Pre-Blocked Assets",
      isoSec2P1: "Our service has no shared central relational database. Each mailbox exists solely as an ephemeral in-memory container accessible via deterministic O(1) hash routing. No user or container can ever inspect another session.",
      isoSec2P2: "By default, our engine strips all external image requests and tracking beacons from incoming HTML bodies. Your real IP address is never revealed to marketing trackers, while providing a safe button to show images if you choose.",
      isoCompRow1Feat: "Hidden Tracking Pixel Blocking",
      isoCompRow1Legacy: "Automatically loaded; IP address leaked",
      isoCompRow1Our: "Blocked by default (100% IP protected)",
      isoCompRow2Feat: "Session Isolation Architecture",
