      mlFaq1Q: "What is a magic link?",
      mlFaq1A: "A magic link is a passwordless authentication URL containing an encrypted, single-use token that logs you in immediately upon clicking.",
      mlFaq2Q: "Why do magic links expire on other temporary email platforms?",
      mlFaq2A: "Because their backend systems run automated security scanners that visit the link before you do, consuming the single-use token.",
